      "description": "One digit of eight LEDs (segments a-g and the dot dp). Common cathode: COM to GND, and each segment through its own resistor (220-330 ohm) to a pin: HIGH lights it. (Common anode: COM to 5 V, LOW lights a segment.) Pick which kind in its settings.",
